    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/34806806e905c857d0f2cd15e6045231.webp?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an alternate <i>World War II era setting</i>, where <strong>dieselpunk</strong> technology and eldritch horrors collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powered by Unreal Engine 5</strong> and latest technologies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/2a0db6292bb99e8db53c640bf8f17876.poster.avif?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/2a0db6292bb99e8db53c640bf8f17876.webm?t=1747609084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/ba8e06055f2ab4ea79b8b75dd590be6f.webp?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you see monsters, corpses, or are covered in darkness - your <strong>FEAR</strong> increases, and if you do not take care of it - soon you will become a <strong>GHOUL</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce your <strong>FEAR</strong> with alcohol, keep generator lights on, and take care of your teammates with a good punch of the holy book.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/960619bf54f5921107fda9909465028e.poster.avif?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/960619bf54f5921107fda9909465028e.webm?t=1747609084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/2d7043774538141aab0f2efdefc05d63.webp?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in <i>Amnesia </i>games, you can smoothly interact with doors / chests / traps. But if you have no time - <strong>DON'T HESITATE</strong> - kick it to open faster, but making more noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides taking items into your inventory, you can grab them and throw anywhere to see what happens. <i>Also your teammates can catch them in fly.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what about an oil barrel and a flare? \ud83e\udd14</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/bff9217e09502ab4f0430bec311c8d17.poster.avif?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/bff9217e09502ab4f0430bec311c8d17.webm?t=1747609084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/f4677ace064c9ad815d2892211af26be.webp?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Someone </i></strong>from your crew must become a<strong> LIGHT KEEPER</strong> and stay on the surface to refuel the bunker generator and keep an eye on the radar to notify you about any threats or valuable loot nearby.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful - <strong><i>THE GUARDIAN ENTITY DOES NOT LIKE GENERATORS</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/1c98998cd2208a25b5ce3f63bf2015fa.poster.avif?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/1c98998cd2208a25b5ce3f63bf2015fa.webm?t=1747609084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/34806806e905c857d0f2cd15e6045231.webp?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an alternate <i>World War II era setting</i>, where <strong>dieselpunk</strong> technology and eldritch horrors collide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powered by Unreal Engine 5</strong> and latest technologies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/2a0db6292bb99e8db53c640bf8f17876.poster.avif?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/2a0db6292bb99e8db53c640bf8f17876.webm?t=1747609084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/ba8e06055f2ab4ea79b8b75dd590be6f.webp?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you see monsters, corpses, or are covered in darkness - your <strong>FEAR</strong> increases, and if you do not take care of it - soon you will become a <strong>GHOUL</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce your <strong>FEAR</strong> with alcohol, keep generator lights on, and take care of your teammates with a good punch of the holy book.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"