></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Someone </i></strong>from your crew must become a<strong> LIGHT KEEPER</strong> and stay on the surface to refuel the bunker generator and keep an eye on the radar to notify you about any threats or valuable loot nearby.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful - <strong><i>THE GUARDIAN ENTITY DOES NOT LIKE GENERATORS</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/1c98998cd2208a25b5ce3f63bf2015fa.poster.avif?t=1747609084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312250/extras/1c98998cd2208a25b5ce3f63bf2015fa.webm?t=1747609084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
